<p>Renders a <code>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code>, typically for totals or
  summary rows. See the
  <a href="/components/table/">Table demo</a> for the composed
  example including an "Average" row in the foot.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;Table label="Budget"&gt;
  &lt;TableFoot&gt;
    &lt;TableRow&gt;
      &lt;TableTD&gt;Total&lt;/TableTD&gt;
      &lt;TableTD&gt;$1,000&lt;/TableTD&gt;
    &lt;/TableRow&gt;
  &lt;/TableFoot&gt;
&lt;/Table&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
